{"attachments":[{"content_type":"image/jpeg","filename":"grovekeeper-1.jpg","id":"865990363932262420","local_path":"discord/empire-city/attachments/861037314298085387/865990363932262420-grovekeeper-1.jpg","message_id":"865990364182478878","sha256":"9c1ba87812d6f7715ac67cf40f426addbdfcd73920c6c6622d2c6d9126911ec5","size":697355,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/861037314298085387/865990363932262420/grovekeeper-1.jpg?ex=6ac081a0&is=6abf3020&hm=e7389f1e08233d0dd4e726ea626b8e8f7a3b8dd8c4c32b9c123df35a0fb92dce&"}],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:16:32.144000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865990364182478878","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"she performs a small, shaky bow.","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:16:54.092000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865990456239194132","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'I assume... you know what I talked about with the Mender just now?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:17:03.602000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865990496127025173","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Yes.\" \n\"Once asked. Once answered.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:17:39.133000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865990645156282368","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'Alright. Then...' she takes a deep, unneeded breath; Kukudh nuzzles against her cheek. 'Can you tell me... who I am---who I was, before I died?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:18:51.615000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865990949166645278","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Yes.\" \n\"Twice asked. Twice answered.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:19:36.563000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865991137692221470","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'...will you tell me? Or is it better if I do not know?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:20:03.695000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865991251492864030","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Who you are is not who you were. If you are you now. Then you were not you then. There is no identity but that which you exist in.\"\n\"Thrice asked. Thrice Answered.\"\n\n\"A memory, a thought or a life. Which will you pay us for the 3 questions asked and answered.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:22:25.261000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865991845263835187","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'...what do you mean? A memory, I get, but... a thought, or a life?'","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:24:31.357000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-17T16:36:54.341000Z","id":"865992374147481630","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"Thrice asked. Thrice answered. Offer payment, lest it be taken from you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:25:00.923000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865992498156535838","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"(heck what does a thought mean)","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:25:49.009000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865992699843838014","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
