{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"The ravens begin to peer into your mind, becoming anxious to see what may be given.","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:28:34.388000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-17T16:28:49.610000Z","id":"865993393493245953","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'...when I entered Empire City, I found purpose. I became a new me. But the struggle that lead me there is important to remember, too...' she muses.","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:30:10.726000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865993797565022218","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'...the Mender told me that it was not possible to truly pass on here. If giving my life would allow me to be reborn, free of the shackles of the... horror that seems to own me... I will gladly do so.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:34:16.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865994828500566037","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"\"You choose death then?\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:35:27.801000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865995127474487296","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"861037314298085387","content":"'What is death to one who is already dead? If I am able to be reborn, then I will be a new me, free of shackles. If I am not... then please, for the good of the world, sever me from the pact my old self has made.'","created_at":"2021-07-17T16:36:32.330000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865995398128468018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
